  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzZfZSS/Lucky-Blocks-Sky-Wars.png\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><br>&nbsp; 一張可與朋友同樂的Skywars PVP地圖</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>地圖資訊</strong></em></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong><span>本地圖支援2-8名玩家！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一張<strong>運氣決定勝負</strong>的趣味地圖！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與<strong>好友</strong>一較高下，看看誰才是<strong>天選之人</strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地圖上佈滿了充滿驚喜的<strong>幸運方塊</strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">內建<strong>死亡計數器</strong>可設定遊戲結束條件</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>配置重生點</strong>避免遊戲挫折感！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00;font-size:18px\">本地圖原生支援1.16.5版本</span><br></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px;text-align:left\"><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/596/280/2023-01-05_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"635\" height=\"357\"></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組版本需求：</strong> Lucky Block Forge/Fabric 1.16.5-8.0 或更高版本</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.luckyblockmod.com%252fdownload%253fplatform%253dforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.luckyblockmod.com/download</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align